{"id":"tem","lemma":"тем","pos":"adv","rank":163,"glosses":["the (to that degree, to the same degree)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/83/Ru-%D1%82%D0%B5%D0%BC.ogg/Ru-%D1%82%D0%B5%D0%BC.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Между тем, что вы сделали?","en":"What did you do in the meantime?","words":[{"g":"between, among"},null,{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},{"g":"to make, to do","l":"сделать"}]},{"text":"Чем больше людей, тем лучше.","en":"The more people, the better.","words":[{"g":"than"},{"g":"any more"},{"g":"people, humans","l":"люди"},null,{"g":"rather, would better )"}]},{"text":"Если это так — тем лучше.","en":"If that's so, all the better.","words":[{"g":"if, in case"},{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"so"},null,{"g":"rather, would better )"}]},{"text":"Всё осталось тем же.","en":"Everything remained the same.","words":[{"g":"everything, all"},{"g":"to remain, to stay","l":"остаться"},null,{"g":"(emphasis)"}]},{"text":"Чем меньше ты знаешь, тем лучше.","en":"The less you know, the better.","words":[{"g":"than"},{"g":"small, little","l":"малый"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"},null,{"g":"rather, would better )"}]}]}